					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This makes a really neat kinda-origin on the plague doctor.<br /> I do want to point out two things, but they're not really crit and more &quot;i noticed one inconsistency and a formatting issue&quot;.</p> <p>Which is, uh, I noticed an inconsistency and a formatting issue.</p> <p>Specifically, his 'catchphrase' being both &quot;let me see him with live once again&quot; and &quot;let me see him once more alive&quot; being the inconsistency, and the formatting issue being the last line going off the 'page'. Though with that last one, it also does that on the Spanish wiki, so could it be intentional?</p> 
				 	]]>
